{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日朝おきたて立ち上がったときに、左脚が上手く動かなくて。\n右脚の親指突き指しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まげるとめちゃめちゃいたい。(･_ゝ･)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セゾンと大人踊れるか心配。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか自分で面白くなってくる…笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近9時にねたら次の日の目の空き具合がハンパじゃなくて、めちゃぱっちりなってて。嬉しかった。( ´ ▽ ` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は全握井口とです。楽しみ。緊張するけど。普通にするね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綾波レイすっごいかわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2GYAVP5W9G3643FJTH9Q0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか雰囲気ちがう〜〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね!"}],"source":"archive"}